(text "USB-C (USB 2.0 device, 5V sink)" (at 30.48 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid a795e921-71a4-4aae-a3d4-221889c271cb))
(text "Separate 5.1k Rd on CC1 and CC2 (sharing one breaks some chargers).\nCC voltage at ADC: <0.66V default USB, 0.66-1.23V 1.5A, >1.23V 3A.\nUSBLC6 at the connector: D+/D- flow through pins 1-6 / 3-4." (at 30.48 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4ef3e427-0e84-4262-9442-cee4aa596340))
(text "QWIIC (I2C, 3.3V)" (at 241.3 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid f9dae6ba-289d-4df7-81b2-e926673335eb))
(text "Cut JP1/JP2 to remove the on-board pull-ups when\nchaining several Qwiic boards that already have them." (at 241.3 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0cac2759-ad07-40eb-a9fa-42a42f9b8917))
